    <section class="az-about-values"><div class="az-wrap"><div class="az-about-values-title"><p class="az-kicker az-dark"><span></span> WHAT GUIDES US</p><h2>Technology earns its place only when it improves the space.</h2></div><div class="az-about-values-list"><article><span>01</span><div><h3>Simple at the surface</h3><p>Sophistication belongs behind the scenes. Everyday control should feel immediate and obvious.</p></div></article><article><span>02</span><div><h3>Designed as one</h3><p>Automation, AV, security and networking perform better when planned together.</p></div></article><article><span>03</span><div><h3>Made for real routines</h3><p>The system adapts to the people and the property—not the other way around.</p></div></article><article><span>04</span><div><h3>Confidence beyond handover</h3><p>Good integration includes explanation, accountability and dependable ongoing support.</p></div></article></div></div></section>
    ' . aerizone_cta() . '</main>';
}

